### Phase 13 — Preview credential governance sweep
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/admin/users/credential-governance/sweep
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dryRun": true,
  "markExpired": true,
  "createReviewTasks": true,
  "queueReminders": true,
  "expiringSoonDays": 30,
  "dueInDays": 7,
  "limit": 50
}

### Phase 13 — Execute credential governance sweep
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/admin/users/credential-governance/sweep
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dryRun": false,
  "markExpired": true,
  "createReviewTasks": true,
  "queueReminders": true,
  "expiringSoonDays": 30,
  "dueInDays": 7,
  "limit": 250
}

### Phase 13 — Sweep one organization as Super Admin
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/admin/users/credential-governance/sweep
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": "{{organizationId}}",
  "dryRun": false,
  "markExpired": true,
  "createReviewTasks": true,
  "queueReminders": true,
  "expiringSoonDays": 45,
  "dueInDays": 10,
  "limit": 500
}

### Phase 13 — Sweep one provider only
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/admin/users/credential-governance/sweep
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "providerId": "{{providerId}}",
  "dryRun": false,
  "markExpired": true,
  "createReviewTasks": true,
  "queueReminders": false,
  "expiringSoonDays": 30,
  "dueInDays": 5,
  "limit": 1
}
